# An ALLOWLIST: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
#
# Everything is excluded, then each COPY source is let back in. A checkout carries
# results trees, data, benchmarks and caches beside the code (about 557 GB on the lab
# server); a builder without this file, or with a denylist that misses one new folder,
# tars all of it into the context. A COPY whose source is not listed here fails the
# build, so a new COPY needs its line here too.
*
!Snakefile
!clinego
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES
!VERSION
!workflow/
!scripts/
!test_data/

# Caches and local state inside the allowed folders never belong in the image.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.Rhistory
**/.RData
**/.Rproj.user
**/.DS_Store
